<title>GERMANY: Germany's Hapag sees 1996 oper profit down.</title>
<headline>Germany's Hapag sees 1996 oper profit down.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German tourism and shipping tour group Hapag-Lloyd AG said on Tuesday it was expecting 1996 operating profit of 230-240 million marks compared to 265 million marks in the year before.</p>
<p>Hapag said non-realisable profits of over 45 million marks ($29.6 million) this year and 138 million marks last year were not included in the estimate.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.522 German Marks)</p>
